# Images are stored as normal Git blobs (NOT Git LFS). The self-updating
# installer downloads GitHub source tarballs, and those do not resolve LFS
# pointers — an LFS-tracked image ships as its ~130-byte pointer text instead of
# the real file, which breaks the app UI (and crashes the macOS webview icon).
# Keeping them as plain binaries guarantees tarballs contain the real images.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
